                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Riddle to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1896-04-25"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 25,
                    1896</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Knapp was this morning delivered by Turkish authorities to American consular
                    agent at Alexandretta.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Riddle.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
